    <code>&#123;"errors": &#123;"name": ["can't be blank"]&#125;&#125;</code>.
  </p>
  <p>
    While you write specs, run <code>npm run dev</code> in{" "}
    <code>docs-site/</code> and the swaggerize task in another terminal.{" "}
